 Japan&amp;rsquo;s most wanted&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; In Asia-Pacific &lt;p&gt; A Japanese company launches an online slot machine game featuring the mug-shots of the country&amp;rsquo;s most wanted. &lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Gaming grub</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/gaming-grub/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Oct 2008 12:41:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/gaming-grub/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a onblur="try {parent.deselectBloggerImageGracefully();} catch(e) {}" href="http://www.gamergrub.com/grub/index.php"&gt;&lt;img style="margin: 0pt 10px 10px 0pt; float: left; cursor: pointer;" src="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiGy5KUuVAflahDZ92usBfIknUMDKO6ohHqo7WWJRgcBJFjX0SUjKGD0yVxZHRk-v-WMxg2W-Z_ISP2xQQxInqT-LyRChW0OvirE1O21d1R1DX7jnsgOudXA-IgkCB570N2VFrH4rtrwKU/s320/ScreenShot001.jpg" alt="" id="BLOGGER_PHOTO_ID_5254005009812121954" border="0" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;ldquo;Gamer Grub is a great tasting snack that boosts your core gaming systems, such as visual input, cognitive processing, signal transmission and muscle reflexes for maximum gaming performance.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Basically a meal in a can, kinda like those weight loss drinks. So you can keep gaming all night long. In my day we had to make do with pizza, crisps, chocolate and fizz drinks!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://meekgonkey.blogspot.com/"&gt;Doodle&amp;rsquo;s Geek Monkey&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="http://twitter.com/alastair_hm"&gt;Alastair Montgomery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Tooth Tunes - get that song out of my head!</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/tooth-tunes-get-that-song-out-of-my/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Oct 2008 09:20:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/tooth-tunes-get-that-song-out-of-my/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; 2 of this post&amp;rsquo;s 7 links are now broken — mostly dead 2008–